  "document": {
    "abstract": "This Administrative Guideline defines the numbering format for SMPTE Engineering Documents and specifies the permitted file formats used during document development and publication. It also specifies other matters relating to SMPTE Engineering Documents with regard to language, style, format, document type, markups required at various stages of development, etc.\nFiles that show the differences between two versions of the same document are called \"markups\" in this Administrative Guideline. \"Markup\" is intended to cover a variety of terms including: \"redline,\" \"tracked changes,\" \"blackline,\" etc.",
